          "title": "ABOUT YASAD",
          "text": "<p>With choices of 1, 2 and 3 bedroom luxury apartments we can cater for singles, couples, families and friends.<br><br>All apartments are fully furnished with modern designs and decor and include showers, air conditioning, individual safes, cutlery, crockery and linen.<br><br>Services and amenities include daily maid service, beach towels and a starter pack of essentials as well as:</p><br><p>FREE WiFi<br>FREE Local Calls<br>FREE Cable Television</p>",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-lg animated fadeInUp delay btn-warning\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">LEARN MORE</a>"
