          "headerAlign": "left",
          "title": "DISCOVER PRASLIN",
          "meta": "By John Smith posted July 30, 2015",
          "text": "<p>Praslin is Seychelles' second largest island and has a population of approximately 7,000 people.<br><br></p><p>The island is a popular destination for tourists as it is home to some of the world's most exquisite beaches such as Anse Lazio and Anse Georgette.<br><br></p><p>At the centre of Praslin lies the Vallee de Mai nature reserve. The Valle is host to six species of endemic palms which can only be found in Seychelles.<br></p>",
          "button": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-lg btn-default\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">LEARN MORE</a>"
        },
        {
