          "headerAlign": "left",
          "header": "DROP-DEAD EASY WEBSITE MAKER",
          "subheader": "By John Smith posted July 30, 2015",
          "media1": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/vall-de-mai-850x531-5.jpg",
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "width": 600,
              "link": "",
              "alt": "",
              "title": "",
              "linkInNewWindow": false
            },
            "video": {
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "src": "http://www.youtube.com/embed/sOSTC6FM6Bw"
            }
          },
          "title1": "VALLEE DE MAI",
          "caption1": "The legendary Vallee de Mai is one of two UNESCO World Heritage sites in Seychelles and was once believed to be the original Garden of Eden.<br><br>It is the largest intact forest of the endemic Coco de Mer palm.<br><br>Follow the trails through this unique palm forest to discover the ancient secrets it holds.<br>",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-default\">LEARN MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/anse-lazio-1600x1000-61.jpg",
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "width": 600,
              "link": "",
              "alt": "",
              "title": "",
              "linkInNewWindow": false
            },
            "video": {
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "src": "http://www.youtube.com/embed/sOSTC6FM6Bw"
            }
          },
          "title2": "ANSE LAZIO",
          "caption2": "Anse Lazio is the most famous beach on Praslin and is often listed among the world's top 10 beaches.<br><br>Beautifully framed by granite rocks, this dream beach has soft white sands which lead gently down to the calm clear waters that are perfect for swimming.<br>",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-default\">LEARN MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/fishing-538x343-76.jpg",
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "width": 600,
              "link": "",
              "alt": "",
              "title": "",
              "linkInNewWindow": false
            },
            "video": {
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "src": "http://www.youtube.com/embed/sOSTC6FM6Bw"
            }
          },
          "title3": "FISHING",
          "caption3": "Whether you are an experienced sports fisherman or an enthusiastic beginner, you will be thrilled by the opportunities that Seychelles' fish-rich waters offer.<br><br>Try your hand at big-game fishing and the unforgettable experience of trolling in pristine azure waters.<br><br>You may also get the chance to try the traditional method of bottom-fishing where you can catch some of the finest tasting fish on the planet.<br>",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-default\">LEARN MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/diving-559x359-12.jpg",
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "width": 600,
              "link": "",
              "alt": "",
              "title": "",
              "linkInNewWindow": false
            },
            "video": {
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "src": "http://www.youtube.com/embed/sOSTC6FM6Bw"
            }
          },
          "title4": "DIVING",
          "caption4": "One of Seychelles' best kept secrets is the many opportunities it offers for world-class diving on both granite and coral reefs teeming with shoals of coral fish in warm, crystal waters still untouched by man.<br><br>The Inner Islands feature an abundance of fish, even on shallow inshore reefs.<br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-default\">LEARN MORE</a>",
          "media5": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "src": "images/blocks.png",
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "width": 600
            },
            "video": {
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "src": "http://www.youtube.com/embed/sOSTC6FM6Bw"
            }
          },
          "title5": "TRENDY WEBSITE BLOCKS",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "button5": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-default\">LEARN MORE</a>",
          "media6": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "src": "images/host.png",
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "width": 600
            },
            "video": {
              "class": "mbr-figure__img",
              "src": "http://www.youtube.com/embed/sOSTC6FM6Bw"
            }
          },
          "title6": "HOST ANYWHERE",
          "caption6": "Publish your website to a local drive, FTP or host on Amazon S3, Google Drive, Github. Don't limit yourself to just one platform or service provider.",
          "button6": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-default\">LEARN MORE</a>"
        },
